"The princess worked in the rosegarden from 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock to tidy it up.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"From 02:00 till 15:30 o'clock, she worked in the rosegarden to tidy it up\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The princess's mother did not appreciate that the princess worked in the garden.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"Her mother did not appreciate that she, as a princess, would actually work in the garden\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The princess did not care about her mother's lack of appreciation.\",\n      \"line\": 8,\n      \"span\": \"the princess didn't care\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The rosegarden lost all its life in winter.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"The rosegarden lost all his life in winter\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The young lady could not enjoy the colors and all the life the rosegarden harbored.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"the young lady could not enjoy the beautiful colors and all the life the rosegarden harbored\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Once spring arrived, the rosegarden turned back to life and color.\",\n      \"line\": 13,\n      \"span\": \"once spring arrived, it turned back to life and color\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The rose garden was the private property of the royal family.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"the rose garden was the private property of the royal family\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st.\",\n      \"line\": 17,\n      \"span\": \"the young princess insisted on making the garden accessible to the public every March 1st to March 31st\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"People from all over the country traveled to the castel to wander through the rosegarden.\",\n      \"line\": 18,\n      \"span\": \"people from all over the country traveled to the castel to enjoy a nice day wandering through the rosegarden\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"It became a tradition for outside visitors to pick their favorite scenery and attempt to draw it.\",\n      \"line\": 22,\n      \"span\": \"It became tradition that everyone who visited the rosegarden from the outside picked their favorite scenery and tried to draw what they liked most\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Visitors sent postcards to their home.\",\n      \"line\": 22,\n      \"span\": \"They then sent the postcard to their home\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"People made bets on whether postcards arrived at their home before they arrived home.\",\n      \"line\": 23,\n      \"span\": \"People were starting to make bets on whether the postcard arrived at their home before they arrived home\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"In many cases, postcards and people arrived at their home at the same time.\",\n      \"line\": 24,\n      \"span\": \"in many cases, it was a tie\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"People and postcards were usually transported in the same carriage.\",\n      \"line\": 24,\n      \"span\": \"the people and the postcards were usually transported in the same carriage\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":306756,"type":"result","duration_ms":312992,"uuid":"73c58457-fd3a-4fb7-9f30-e63b943318e7","ttft_stream_ms":675,"time_to_request_ms":59,"first_content_frame_ms":675,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
